    "detailed_description": "Steel Manticore is a 3D FPS.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the Saraif Republic, the government is on the verge of collapse. Play as a Republican Guard robot pilot to prevent an anti-government uprising.<br />\r\nUse main guns, machine guns, rockets, missiles and grenades to defeat your enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA total of 8 stages including practice stages.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt also supports VR.<br />\r\nPlease turn off the VR device when switching to non-VR.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Key config with keyboard<br />\r\nShot: Left click<br />\r\nWeapon change: Right click<br />\r\nMove cursor: Mouse movement<br />\r\nJump: Space<br />\r\nForward\uff0fBackward: \u2191 or W\uff0f\u2193 or S<br />\r\nTurn left/right \uff08Move left/right\uff09: \u2190 or A\uff0f\u2192or D <br />\r\nRotation reset: middle click, left/right ctrl<br />\r\nEnd stage: Press and hold ESC key.<br />\r\nClose description: Z<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Key config VR<br />\r\nShot: Trigger<br />\r\nWeapon change: Grip (right-hand controller)<br />\r\nMove cursor: Left-right controller movement<br />\r\nJump: Grip (left-hand controller)<br />\r\nForward\uff0fBackward: Joystick or trackpad\u2191\uff0f\u2193<br />\r\nTurn left/right: Joystick or trackpad \u2190\uff0f\u2192",
